  "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nI have both dash. and proxmox interaction. In \"System health monitoring\", i can set both of them. But on \"System resources\" i can only set dash., tho its supported according to [docs](https://homarr.dev/docs/widgets/system-resources/).\n\nIntegrations:\n<img width=\"222\" height=\"116\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/00903420-0dea-4976-a88f-512b2c7cdaf7\" />\n\nSystem Health Monitoring:\n<img width=\"240\" height=\"181\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8cdb2b0b-2a99-4a52-abaa-d7ec6b9c4ea0\" />\n\nSystem Resources:\n<img width=\"178\" height=\"136\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6b939d5c-3003-4f9c-a4e1-adc388209627\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAdd proxmox interaction.\nAdd dash. interaction.\nCan't use proxmox one.\n\n### Impact\n\nNeed to use dash. for this widget\n\n### Additional information\n\nInstalled from [Proxmox VE Helper-Scripts](https://community-scripts.github.io/ProxmoxVE/scripts?id=homarr).\n\n### Version\n\n1.33.0\n\n### Installation method\n\nOther (describe in \"additional information\")\n\n### Browser\n\nBrave",
